This directory contains the FidelityFX SDK API and denoiser public headers used
to compile optional RTGI FidelityFX denoiser integration points.

Only source headers are vendored. Runtime binaries are intentionally external.

Imported from GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/FidelityFX-SDK commit e236f23. The
vendored API and denoiser headers carry their own MIT-style copyright notice.
